; Exports for the SAPI 5 engine DLL. Only the four COM entry points are public;
; the vendored pico engine is linked in statically and is built with PICO_STATIC
; so that none of its symbols leak out alongside them.
LIBRARY

EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject   PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow     PRIVATE
    DllRegisterServer   PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer PRIVATE
